[00:18.00] Rosalie
[00:20.92] I've been waiting all evening
[00:26.84] Possibly years I don't know
[00:35.82] Counting the passing hours
[00:40.58] Everything merges with the night
[00:44.76] I stand on the beach
[00:57.66] Giving out descriptions
[01:03.66] Different for everyone I see
[01:11.34] Since I just can't remember
[01:16.74] Longer than last September.
[01:31.90] Santiago
[01:33.32] Under the volcano
[01:39.74] Floats like a cushion on the sea
[01:49.20] Yet I can never sleep here
[01:53.10] Everything ponders in the night.
[02:43.68] Rosalie
[02:45.96] We've been talking all summer
[02:52.38] Picking the straw from our clothes
[03:00.38] See how the breeze has softened
[03:06.22] Everything pauses in the night.
